  <div class="vis-title">Review at AI velocity</div>
  <div class="vis-subtitle">When AI is doing the coding, who's doing the reviewing?</div>
  <div style="flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; gap:28px;">
    <div class="vis-grid-2" style="gap:24px;">
      <!-- Before -->
      <div class="vis-card" style="padding:24px;">
        <p style="font-size:11px; font-weight:600; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.15em; color:#64748b; margin:0 0 8px 0;">Before</p>
        <p style="font-size:22px; font-weight:700; color:#fff; margin:0 0 16px 0;">Humans wrote code at human pace</p>
        <ul style="margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:15px; color:#94a3b8; line-height:1.8;">
          <li>A few PRs per dev per day</li>
          <li>Reviewer capacity roughly matched input</li>
          <li>Manual review tedious but tractable</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <!-- After -->
      <div class="vis-card" style="padding:24px; border-color:rgba(248,113,113,0.4); background:rgba(127,29,29,0.1);">
