        <p style="font-size:22px; font-weight:700; color:#fff; margin:0 0 16px 0;">Code volume jumps — reviewer count doesn't</p>
        <ul style="margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:15px; color:#94a3b8; line-height:1.8;">
          <li>More PRs, more often, larger diffs</li>
